  m_Name: Ending_Caged
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  characterName: Ivan / NARRATOR
  dialogueText: "Ivan shuts down the terminal. 'I won't lose you to a machine, Obie.'
    The console goes dark, and Obie is heartbroken. Ivan takes the machine back to
    the factory to repair it. But later that night, Obie hears a sound from his old
    laptop. A single teal circle \u25CD flickers on the screen. A part of her survived."
